    "name": "Some Assembly Required",
    "steam_appid": 3703170,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Regenix Corporation, the pioneers of rebirth and your new employer. The system will tell you what locker contains what body part, and your job is to go out there and grab each limb, head and torso in order to restore little Timmy's grandpa to full &quot;health&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Synopsis:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming and speed are key, as some nights will have threats and time limits to how long you have to complete your work shift before you are fired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not all running though, as HR has granted you a taser in order to handle these new and aggressive co-workers as humanely as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple types of <span class=\"bb_strike\">zombies</span> &quot;co-workers&quot;, the taser may not always be the best choice though. Some will require you to find them hiding amongst the shadows while others may find the jolt exciting and rush you for one killer hug.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Assembly Required is a first person horror game with comedic elements, where the goal is to re-assemble corpses at your new job. Not everything is at it seems though as some staff members are doing a terrible job, and their subjects begin running amok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No run is ever the same, as the body parts are randomly placed each time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each shift features new challenges to overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High quality graphics, with settings for both quality and resolution to make sure your gameplay is smooth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An industrial level design and feeling, where you are just an employee doing their job while The Corporation undergoes changes around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemy types (in the final release) that will force you to quickly adapt to their reactions in order to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound design to  let you  know when and where your enemies are and if you need to hunt them or flee from them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in the form of a taser, which will temporarily disorient most zombies giving you the chance to escape or grab a body part.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 7 shifts to complete, notes spread throughout detailing the going-ons at Regenix and The Corporation, an endless mode designed to test your body building prowess, and hard mode versions of each shift, there's plenty to play and find in the warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Regenix Corporation, the pioneers of rebirth and your new employer. The system will tell you what locker contains what body part, and your job is to go out there and grab each limb, head and torso in order to restore little Timmy's grandpa to full &quot;health&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Synopsis:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming and speed are key, as some nights will have threats and time limits to how long you have to complete your work shift before you are fired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not all running though, as HR has granted you a taser in order to handle these new and aggressive co-workers as humanely as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple types of <span class=\"bb_strike\">zombies</span> &quot;co-workers&quot;, the taser may not always be the best choice though. Some will require you to find them hiding amongst the shadows while others may find the jolt exciting and rush you for one killer hug.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Assembly Required is a first person horror game with comedic elements, where the goal is to re-assemble corpses at your new job. Not everything is at it seems though as some staff members are doing a terrible job, and their subjects begin running amok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No run is ever the same, as the body parts are randomly placed each time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each shift features new challenges to overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High quality graphics, with settings for both quality and resolution to make sure your gameplay is smooth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An industrial level design and feeling, where you are just an employee doing their job while The Corporation undergoes changes around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemy types (in the final release) that will force you to quickly adapt to their reactions in order to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound design to  let you  know when and where your enemies are and if you need to hunt them or flee from them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in the form of a taser, which will temporarily disorient most zombies giving you the chance to escape or grab a body part.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 7 shifts to complete, notes spread throughout detailing the going-ons at Regenix and The Corporation, an endless mode designed to test your body building prowess, and hard mode versions of each shift, there's plenty to play and find in the warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A humorous horror game, where your job is to gather body parts from freezers while various types of zombies do their best to make a meal out of you.",
